The '''Chairman of the Industrial Party of Burawa''' is the highest-ranking position within the [[Industrial Party of Burawa]], responsible for setting party policy, representing the party in public, and serving as the party's candidate for [[Leader of the Burawi Republic]] in leadership elections.

The position is filled by vote of the party congress, which convenes to elect party leadership.

